+The clip fixture compiles the extracted production `stream_gather`, `strips_lean`, `lean_flush`, `clip_strip`, page inputs and receipt block with production `pvr_geometry.cpp` in normal and ASan/UBSan modes, with and without pages. A 65-index strip against output capacity 64 yields 63 input/63 emitted triangles and a receipt; the three-near-rejected-vertex case also totals 63/63 after lost/split balancing but is refused. Full depth and screen/backface culls are refused; sparse and full gather emit byte-equal TA words. Two ordered pages commit once, while a poisoned first page, either page refusal, and final borrowed-batch view/material/plan mutation cannot commit. Stream and page source regressions pass normal and sanitizer paths. The portal host reports 388 loader/runtime and 628 actual receipt checks in both normal and sanitizer runs. `git diff --check` passes for the complete owned patch.
