+
+**Exact private target command form for a fresh matched control/ON qualification:** retain the corrected rr release CH2 profile and portal options on both arms. The three clipper settings `SCENERY_CLIP_GATHER`, `MESH_CLIP_LEAN`, and `MESH_CLIP_ACCEPT` are explicit, with the scoped completion switch separate. This is for the coordinator's SDK/private workspace and has not been run in this cloud worktree.
+
+```bash
+set -euo pipefail
+source <(tr -d '\r' < port/dreamcast/tools/d367/rr/recipe.conf)
+PORTAL_OPTIONS=$(python3 -B -c 'import json; print(" ".join(json.load(open("port/dreamcast/tools/cloud/build31/portal_completion_profiles.json"))["on_options"]))')
